1
00:00:00,030 --> 00:00:03,847
Your window could frame the Eiffel Tower,
right on the Las Vegas Strip.

2
00:00:03,977 --> 00:00:08,862
This is Paris Las Vegas, rated eight point
four out of ten on Expedia.

3
00:00:08,992 --> 00:00:11,104
Some rooms look straight at the tower.

4
00:00:11,234 --> 00:00:15,174
And the new Versailles tower has balconies
over the Bellagio fountains.

5
00:00:15,304 --> 00:00:18,037
Step outside, and the fountains are a
three minute walk.

6
00:00:18,167 --> 00:00:22,052
There are fifteen restaurants, from Gordon
Ramsay Steak to Nobu.

7
00:00:22,182 --> 00:00:26,840
Add a spa, a sportsbook, and gold trimmed
halls that feel like Paris.

8
00:00:26,970 --> 00:00:29,625
Nearly thirty five thousand guests
reviewed it.

9
00:00:29,755 --> 00:00:32,039
The full tour is on my channel.
